  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_MerendaDaAgriculturaLocal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Merenda compra do produtor local
  _titleEn: School Meals Buy from Local Farms
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Quando a prefeitura compra comida de agricultores familiares da regi\xE3o,
    o dinheiro p\xFAblico fica na economia local e a merenda chega mais fresca \xE0s
    escolas."
  _summaryEn: When the city buys food from local family farmers, public money stays
    in the local economy and school meals arrive fresher.
  _realWorld: "No Brasil, a Lei 11.947, de 2009, obrigou o programa de merenda escolar
    a gastar ao menos 30% da verba federal com a agricultura familiar. Em 2025, o
    m\xEDnimo subiu para 45%."
  _realWorldEn: In Brazil, Law 11,947 of 2009 required the school meal program to
    spend at least 30% of its federal funds on family farming. In 2025 the minimum
    rose to 45%.
  _tradeOffs: "Pequenos produtores nem sempre conseguem entregar com regularidade,
    nota fiscal e padr\xE3o sanit\xE1rio, e a compra local pode sair mais cara."
  _tradeOffsEn: Small farmers cannot always deliver on schedule, with invoices and
    sanitary standards, and buying locally can cost more.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 11.947, de 16 de junho de 2009 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2007-2010/2009/lei/l11947.htm
